GEO:45.5215;-122.6826
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Cristian Mungiu · 146 min\n\nFollowing the deaths of Miha
 i's parents\, Mihai and Lisbet Gheorghiu leave their life behind in Romani
 a and move with their children to a remote village in Norway\, hoping to r
 ebuild their lives near Lisbet's family. There\, they grow close to their 
 neighbors\, the Halbergs\, whose warmth gives them hope for a fresh start.
  But the fragile peace begins to unravel when the Gheorghiu family’s you
 ng daughter\, Elia\, arrives at school covered in bruises.\n\nTickets: htt
 ps://pdx.livingroomtheaters.com/purchase/fjord?showingId=4266654\n\nMore s
 howtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
