SUMMARY:Chariots Of Fire (1981)
LOCATION:Hollywood Theatre\, 4122 NE Sandy Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5315;-122.624
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Hugh Hudson · 123 min\n\nFormat: 35mm\n\nIn the class-obs
 essed and religiously divided UK of the early 1920s\, two determined young
  runners train for the 1924 Paris Olympics. Eric Liddell\, a devout Christ
 ian born to Scottish missionaries in China\, sees running as part of his w
 orship of God's glory and refuses to train or compete on the Sabbath. Haro
 ld Abrahams overcomes anti-Semitism and class bias\, but neglects his belo
 ved sweetheart in his single-minded quest.\n\nTickets: https://hollywoodth
 eatre.org/event/chariots-of-fire-in-35mm-2026-11-12-730pm/\n\nMore showtim
 es: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://hollywoodtheatre.org/event/chariots-of-fire-in-35mm-2026-11-12-
 730pm/
